{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0215-kth-largest-element","title":"LeetCode 215 数组中的第 K 个最大元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0215-kth-largest-element","wordCount":1000,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-215-数组中的第-k-个最大元素\">LeetCode 215 数组中的第 K 个最大元素</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定整数数组 <code>nums</code> 和整数 <code>k</code>，请返回数组中第 <code>k</code> 个最大的元素。</p>\n<p>注意，你需要找的是数组排序后的第 <code>k</code> 个最大的元素，而不是第 <code>k</code> 个不同的元素。要求设计并实现时间复杂度为 O(n) 的算法解决此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [3,2,1,5,6,4], k = 2&#10;输出：5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [3,2,1,5,6,4], k = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：5</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [3,2,3,1,2,4,5,5,6], k = 4&#10;输出：4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [3,2,3,1,2,4,5,5,6], k = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是经典的 Top-K 问题，有多种解法可以选择，核心在于理解不同方法在时间复杂度和空间复杂度上的权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>最直观的方法是对数组排序后取第 <code>k</code> 个最大值，时间复杂度为 O(n log n)。但题目要求 O(n) 的算法，因此需要更高效的策略。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：快速选择算法（QuickSelect）</strong></p>\n<p>快速选择算法基于快速排序的分区思想。每次选择一个基准元素（pivot），将数组分为三部分：大于 pivot、等于 pivot、小于 pivot。根据 <code>k</code> 与各部分长度的关系，只需要递归处理其中一个部分即可。</p>\n<p>核心原理：假设 pivot 将数组分区后，大于 pivot 的元素有 <code>left</code> 个。如果 <code>k &lt;= left</code>，说明第 k 大元素在左半部分；如果 <code>k &gt; left + equal</code>，说明在右半部分；否则 pivot 本身就是答案。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：小顶堆</strong></p>\n<p>维护一个大小为 <code>k</code> 的小顶堆。遍历数组时，如果堆的大小小于 <code>k</code>，直接入堆；否则，当当前元素大于堆顶时，替换堆顶元素并调整堆。遍历完成后堆顶即为第 <code>k</code> 大元素。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度（平均）</th>\n<th>时间复杂度（最差）</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>简单直接，数据量小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速选择</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>数据量大，求单个第K大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小顶堆</td>\n<td>O(n log k)</td>\n<td>O(n log k)</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>数据流/需要前K个元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFPRT</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>理论最优但常数大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>快速选择在平均情况下性能最优，但最差情况退化为 O(n²)。通过随机化选择 pivot 可以将最差情况的概率降到极低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：快速选择（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findKthLargest(nums: number[], k: number): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const target = n - k;&#10;&#10;  function partition(left: number, right: number): number {&#10;    const randomIdx = left + Math.floor(Math.random() * (right - left + 1));&#10;    [nums[randomIdx], nums[right]] = [nums[right], nums[randomIdx]];&#10;&#10;    const pivot = nums[right];&#10;    let storeIdx = left;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = left; i &lt; right; i++) {&#10;      if (nums[i] &lt; pivot) {&#10;        [nums[i], nums[storeIdx]] = [nums[storeIdx], nums[i]];&#10;        storeIdx++;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [nums[storeIdx], nums[right]] = [nums[right], nums[storeIdx]];&#10;    return storeIdx;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = n - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;    const pivotIdx = partition(left, right);&#10;    if (pivotIdx === target) {&#10;      return nums[pivotIdx];&#10;    } else if (pivotIdx &lt; target) {&#10;      left = pivotIdx + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      right = pivotIdx - 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findKthLargest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> partition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> randomIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [nums[randomIdx], nums[right]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[right], nums[randomIdx]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pivot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[right];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storeIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pivot) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [nums[i], nums[storeIdx]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[storeIdx], nums[i]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storeIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [nums[storeIdx], nums[right]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[right], nums[storeIdx]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storeIdx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pivotIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> partition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(left, right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pivotIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[pivotIdx];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pivotIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pivotIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pivotIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：小顶堆</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findKthLargestHeap(nums: number[], k: number): number {&#10;  const heap: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  function siftUp(i: number): void {&#10;    while (i &gt; 0) {&#10;      const parent = (i - 1) &gt;&gt; 1;&#10;      if (heap[parent] &gt; heap[i]) {&#10;        [heap[parent], heap[i]] = [heap[i], heap[parent]];&#10;        i = parent;&#10;      } else {&#10;        break;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function siftDown(i: number): void {&#10;    const n = heap.length;&#10;    while (2 * i + 1 &lt; n) {&#10;      let smallest = 2 * i + 1;&#10;      if (smallest + 1 &lt; n &amp;&amp; heap[smallest + 1] &lt; heap[smallest]) {&#10;        smallest++;&#10;      }&#10;      if (heap[i] &gt; heap[smallest]) {&#10;        [heap[i], heap[smallest]] = [heap[smallest], heap[i]];&#10;        i = smallest;&#10;      } else {&#10;        break;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    if (heap.length &lt; k) {&#10;      heap.push(num);&#10;      siftUp(heap.length - 1);&#10;    } else if (num &gt; heap[0]) {&#10;      heap[0] = num;&#10;      siftDown(0);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return heap[0];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findKthLargestHeap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A4